\ Monomorph-lite dispatch: `inspect` is a generic native, and its PIC path
\ always emits cold interpreter-callback branches, so this program could not
\ build under the lock before. With statically-proven operands (a literal
\ fixnum, float, and boolean) each site compiles to one direct dispatch call
\ with no fallback; a successful locked build is itself the proof.
30 inspect print-line
2.5 inspect print-line
t inspect print-line
